  {
   "title": "HomePage与router循环依赖致初始化前报错",
   "type": "bug",
   "content": "根因：`router/index.ts` 静态引入 `HomePage`，`HomePage.vue` 引入 `router` 造成循环依赖，触发 `Cannot access 'HomePage' before initialization`。修复：`HomePage.vue` 改用 `useRouter()` 去除顶层 import，`router/index.ts` 首页改为懒加载 `() => import('../views/HomePage.vue')`。",
